in\\\"]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1717:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/3/code.py:688:        if require_cycle and \\\"cycle\\\" not in kinds and (shape_count - len(kinds)) == 1:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1718:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/3/code.py:689:            kinds.append(\\\"cycle\\\")\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1719:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:19:# - 路由不再是任意 permutation，而是严格的一整个 cycle。视觉上看，顶部颜色序列沿管道整体轮转到底部；\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1720:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:24:#   这是一整个 4-cycle。若 A 列顶部过滤块是 3x3，B/C/D 分别是 2x3/4x3/2x2：\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1721:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:25:#   1. 原题：A/B/C/D 都会沿线抵达各自 cycle 目标列。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1722:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:42:# - 原 permutation 可任意分解成多个 cycle；融合后若还允许多个 cycle，人类可能把“某些底部缺失”误判成“另一个独立回路没有源”。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1723:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:43:#   因此 generator 必须生成单一 cycle，避免过滤规则和拓扑规则互相混淆。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1724:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:52:# - 单一 cycle 通过整条线路拓扑可见；过滤规则通过“同样有线路，但有些底部位置始终不出现互补形状”可见。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1725:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:269:      decides whether the token continues around the single cycle or dies at the gate.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:1726:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:343:# --------------- generator (filtered_cycle) ---------------\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab