dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2651:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:43:#       frames rather than part of an infinite modulo cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2656:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/5/code.py:34:#        cycle through [7,3,4]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2657:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/13/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D1/1+D2/2+D10/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2658:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:31:#        segment, legend order provides the actual palette cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2659:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:246:    - Recover the shortest repeating cycle of that legend segment and use it as the\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2660:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:254:    the ordered cycle, and both clues are required because vertical alignment is\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2661:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D10/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2662:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:12:Design analysis for combo D2/2 + D10/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2663:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:46:   - D2/2 引入新的假设：距离最好唯一，否则主规则不明显。solver 用 `(dist2, row, col)` 做稳定\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2665:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:29:#   first depth where the paired palette diverges from the original cycle.  This\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2666:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:39:#   the same \\\"two markers -> four-step paired cycle\\\" motif, the cross-region\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2667:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:158:    The global \\\"same marker count in every region\\\" constraint makes the pairing rule stable across the whole grid: each region presents the same two-marker template, so the output reveals that every marker generates a self-color ring followed by a partner-color ring instead of the original one-color-per-depth cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2668:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/3/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D3/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2669:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/6/code.py:62:#      扫描顺序之外的隐藏属性。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2670:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/36/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D1/2+D2/2+D3/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2671:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/36/code.py:20:Design analysis for the combo variant D1/2 + D2/2 + D3/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2672:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/14/code.py:203:    Key insight: Marker placement no longer tells you the order of the color cycle; position only says whether the base color should occupy the outermost band, while the actual palette order comes from the marker colors themselves.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2673:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/15/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D7/1\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2674:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/15/code.py:20:# Design analysis for combo D2/2 + D7/1\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2675:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/17/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D4/3+D10/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2676:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/2/code.py:92:    这三条线索都来自可见像素结构，不依赖颜色编号大小、扫描顺序等不可视因素。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2677:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/1/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D1/0+D2/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2678:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/1/code.py:21:#       - D2/2 contributes the visible form: the input is a sparse two-color crop made of\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2679:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:76:#   Generator-side scheduling therefore cycles through all 8 legal `(rotation, flip)` branches\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2680:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:78:#   the cycle places the identity branch last, so early calls preferentially expose visible\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2681:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:129:_branch_cycle_index = 0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2682:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:130:_size_cycle_index = 0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2683:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:257:    global _branch_cycle_index\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2684:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:258:    branch = _BRANCH_CYCLE[_branch_cycle_index % len(_BRANCH_CYCLE)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2685:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:259:    _branch_cycle_index += 1\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2686:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:264:    global _size_cycle_index\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2687:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:265:    size = _SIZE_CYCLE[_size_cycle_index % len(_SIZE_CYCLE)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2688:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/13/code.py:266:    _size_cycle_index += 1\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2689:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/23/code.py:70:#   least learnable from examples, the generator cycles through a small, repeated library\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2690:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/10/code.py:83:      不使用颜色数值大小、扫描顺序之类的人类不可见因素；side 选择完全由可见颜色决定。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2691:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:272:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Paint traced lane cells using the fixed red/orange cycle.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2692:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:279:def _count_cycle_color(lengths: list[int], period: int, color: int) -> int:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2693:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:280:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Count how many visible cells of a lane bundle take a specific cycle color.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2694:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:481:      heading. Each emitted ray uses the same fixed [red, orange] cycle, but each color is\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2695:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/23/code.py:594:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Quantify whether the width-controlled color-cycle behavior is visibly present.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2696:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/cesh